# The build context is the repository root. Everything below is either rebuilt
# inside the image or must never be inside one.

# Rebuilt by the image. A host-built artifact would only mask a broken build, and
# `target` in a working checkout is several gigabytes.
**/node_modules
**/target
**/dist
**/.astro
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.rs.bk

# Nothing secret is ever copied into an image. The containers read their whole
# configuration from the environment.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Operator data and local state.
.git
backups/
infra/geoip/*
!infra/geoip/README.md
HANDOFF.md
.claude/
**/.DS_Store
